    "body": "I think it might be worth adding the specific example of the NodeList becoming empty if it switches to hidden, per https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/4804/files#diff-79d32fa8b8f142adfe370fd2405b6ca0R106. I was surprised by that test when reviewing it after this PR, and had to go back and carefully review the definition of \"labeled control\" (thus \"label elements in tree order whose labeled control is the element in question\").\r\n\r\nIt also might be worth stating that this is a live NodeList?",
